  x `source` takes no argument
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-pin/image.kdl:16:5]
 15 |     }
 16 |     source "one" {
    :     ^^^|^^
    :        `-- a path segment
 17 |         remote
    `----
  help: `source` is no image node, so it reads as a component path, and a path
        segment takes no argument

  x `loose/pin` is not a component
    ,-[tests/repos/broken-pin/image.kdl:11:9]
 10 |     loose {
 11 |         pin {
    :         ^|^
    :          `-- nothing to build
 12 |             url "http://example.com/components.zip"
    `----
  help: give components/loose/pin a manifest.kdl, a component.sh, a repo.sh, a
        packages.sh, a finalize.sh, a files/ directory, a Containerfile.inc or
        a file that another component collects, or define it inline with a
        manifest node such as `packages`
